pdftomd includes code ported from the following MIT-licensed projects.

pdf2md.py
  Heuristics ported from Firecrawl's pdf-inspector
  https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector

pdf2md.py, section 13 (spreadsheets)
  Port of the spreadsheet, CSV, header-row and table-rendering code in anydoc
  (src/formats/sheet, src/formats/csv.rs, src/shared/header.rs, src/render/markdown)
  https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc

tests/test_sheet.py
  Test cases ported from anydoc's own tests.

